<title>POLAND: Zywiec Q1 net rises to PLN 4.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Zywiec Q1 net rises to PLN 4.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zywiec preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 9.23 vs	3.40</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   7.76 vs	2.56</p>
<p>    net profit				 4.58 vs	1.60</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Zaklady Piwowarskie w Zywcu Zywiec SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 68.31 vs     43.74</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  36.28 vs     28.37</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.04 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 3.18 vs	0.96</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.82 vs	0.33</p>
<p>    financial costs			  3.25 vs	1.18</p>
<p>    investment				 5.60 vs     13.98</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
